  "description": "This elegant seamless pattern collection features delicate blue floral illustrations, classic botanical branches, timeless striped designs, playful polka dots, and sophisticated chinoiserie-inspired backgrounds in beautiful blue and white color palettes. Inspired by vintage porcelain patterns, French country decor, and traditional botanical artwork, these seamless patterns create a refined and timeless aesthetic perfect for creative projects.\nPerfect for fabric, digital papers, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, wallpaper, stationery, journaling, sublimation, and more. Seamless and high-quality, ideal for both personal and commercial use.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 23 Individual JPEG Files\n👉 Features:\n➤ High-resolution floral pattern designs\n➤ (12×12) Inches, 300 DPI\n➤ Elegant blue botanical illustrations\n➤ Classic stripes and polka dot elements\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns\n➤ Timeless blue and white color palette\n➤ High-resolution quality\n➤ Suitable for print and digital use\n➤ Perfect for fabric, POD & craft projects\n➤ Vintage chinoiserie inspired aesthetic\n➤ JPEG format for wide compatibility with various digital and print projects\n👉 Follow to discover more awesome artwork & seamless patterns.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This elegant seamless pattern collection features delicate blue floral illustrations, classic botanical branches, timeless striped designs, playful polka dots, and sophisticated chinoiserie-inspired backgrounds in beautiful blue and white color palettes. Inspired by vintage porcelain patterns, French country decor, and traditional botanical artwork, these seamless patterns create a refined and timeless aesthetic perfect for creative projects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for fabric, digital papers, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, wallpaper, stationery, journaling, sublimation, and more. Seamless and high-quality, ideal for both personal and commercial use.</p>\n<p>You Will Receive</p>\n<p>➤ 23 Individual JPEG Files</p>\n<p>👉 Features:</p>\n<p>➤ High-resolution floral pattern designs<br>\n➤ (12×12) Inches, 300 DPI<br>\n➤ Elegant blue botanical illustrations<br>\n➤ Classic stripes and polka dot elements<br>\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n➤ Timeless blue and white color palette<br>\n➤ High-resolution quality<br>\n➤ Suitable for print and digital use<br>\n➤ Perfect for fabric, POD &amp; craft projects<br>\n➤ Vintage chinoiserie inspired aesthetic<br>\n➤ JPEG format for wide compatibility with various digital and print projects</p>\n<p>👉 Follow to discover more awesome artwork &amp; seamless patterns.</p>",
